   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786830000000,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Where that bites: fresh ChessDB\nresults built in B2.20 have no\nmate field at all, so getCp()\nreturns NaN for them.\n\nEvery comparison against NaN is\nfalse. Therefore, while using\nthose fresh ChessDB results:\n\n• a candidate that matches a\n  ChessDB line is REJECTED\n\n• a candidate that does not\n  match is sent to deeper search\n\nCached ChessDB rows do not have\nthis problem because their mate\nfield is stored as null.",
   "rawText": "Where that bites: fresh ChessDB\nresults built in B2.20 have no\nmate field at all, so getCp()\nreturns NaN for them.\n\nEvery comparison against NaN is\nfalse. Therefore, while using\nthose fresh ChessDB results:\n\n• a candidate that matches a\n  ChessDB line is REJECTED\n\n• a candidate that does not\n  match is sent to deeper search\n\nCached ChessDB rows do not have\nthis problem because their mate\nfield is stored as null.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "sZWJJE2PWuHYnVYJfFplN",
   "originalText": "Where that bites: fresh ChessDB\nresults built in B2.20 have no\nmate field at all, so getCp()\nreturns NaN for them.\n\nEvery comparison against NaN is\nfalse. Therefore, while using\nthose fresh ChessDB results:\n\n• a candidate that matches a\n  ChessDB line is REJECTED\n\n• a candidate that does not\n  match is sent to deeper search\n\nCached ChessDB rows do not have\nthis problem because their mate\nfield is stored as null.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "hasTextLink": false,
   "link": null
  },
