   "text": "M.02 · Smoothed win rate\n(the maths file)\n\nscore = White wins + half the draws\n\nresult = (score + 50 x 0.52)\n         divided by (games + 50)",
   "rawText": "M.02 · Smoothed win rate\n(the maths file)\n\nscore = White wins + half the draws\n\nresult = (score + 50 x 0.52)\n         divided by (games + 50)",
