   "text": "M.05 · Tolerance table\n(the engine file)\n\nmoves 1-4:   80, local 95\nmoves 5-8:   50, local 60\nmove 9 on:   35, local 40\n\nIn centipawns - hundredths of a pawn.",
   "rawText": "M.05 · Tolerance table\n(the engine file)\n\nmoves 1-4:   80, local 95\nmoves 5-8:   50, local 60\nmove 9 on:   35, local 40\n\nIn centipawns - hundredths of a pawn.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
