   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1786851253710,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "M.07 · Reading a score\n(the engine file)\n\nIf mate is exactly null:\n• use the centipawn value\n• if centipawn is missing,\n  use zero\n\nOtherwise treat it as mate:\n• positive mate:\n  30000 minus mate value\n• zero or negative mate:\n  -30000 minus mate value\n\nImportant:\nif mate is missing rather\nthan null, this calculation\nproduces NaN.",
   "rawText": "M.07 · Reading a score\n(the engine file)\n\nIf mate is exactly null:\n• use the centipawn value\n• if centipawn is missing,\n  use zero\n\nOtherwise treat it as mate:\n• positive mate:\n  30000 minus mate value\n• zero or negative mate:\n  -30000 minus mate value\n\nImportant:\nif mate is missing rather\nthan null, this calculation\nproduces NaN.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "uryit06BDFEgcYgSYz9Mi",
   "originalText": "M.07 · Reading a score\n(the engine file)\n\nIf mate is exactly null:\n• use the centipawn value\n• if centipawn is missing,\n  use zero\n\nOtherwise treat it as mate:\n• positive mate:\n  30000 minus mate value\n• zero or negative mate:\n  -30000 minus mate value\n\nImportant:\nif mate is missing rather\nthan null, this calculation\nproduces NaN.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "hasTextLink": false,
   "link": null
  },
