   "updated": 1786851253712,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "M.09 · The other fixed numbers\n\nmaster games count 5 times an\nelite game (B1.5)\n\na move needs 15 weighted games\nto survive (B1.7)\n\nthe imaginary prior is 50 games:\n52% for White\n48% for Black\n\ncandidate tolerance:\nmoves 1-4: 80 cp\nmoves 5-8: 50 cp\nmove 9 on: 35 cp\n\nlocal-engine tolerance:\nmoves 1-4: 95 cp\nmoves 5-8: 60 cp\nmove 9 on: 40 cp\n\nshallow local engine:\n15 moves, depth 18\n\nforced-mate deep search:\n1 move, depth 24\n\ntactical sweeper:\nflags a difference over 150 cp",
   "rawText": "M.09 · The other fixed numbers\n\nmaster games count 5 times an\nelite game (B1.5)\n\na move needs 15 weighted games\nto survive (B1.7)\n\nthe imaginary prior is 50 games:\n52% for White\n48% for Black\n\ncandidate tolerance:\nmoves 1-4: 80 cp\nmoves 5-8: 50 cp\nmove 9 on: 35 cp\n\nlocal-engine tolerance:\nmoves 1-4: 95 cp\nmoves 5-8: 60 cp\nmove 9 on: 40 cp\n\nshallow local engine:\n15 moves, depth 18\n\nforced-mate deep search:\n1 move, depth 24\n\ntactical sweeper:\nflags a difference over 150 cp",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "FKBURCz1X1UJaiR9zqbbW",
   "originalText": "M.09 · The other fixed numbers\n\nmaster games count 5 times an\nelite game (B1.5)\n\na move needs 15 weighted games\nto survive (B1.7)\n\nthe imaginary prior is 50 games:\n52% for White\n48% for Black\n\ncandidate tolerance:\nmoves 1-4: 80 cp\nmoves 5-8: 50 cp\nmove 9 on: 35 cp\n\nlocal-engine tolerance:\nmoves 1-4: 95 cp\nmoves 5-8: 60 cp\nmove 9 on: 40 cp\n\nshallow local engine:\n15 moves, depth 18\n\nforced-mate deep search:\n1 move, depth 24\n\ntactical sweeper:\nflags a difference over 150 cp",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "hasTextLink": false,
   "link": null
  },
